# Environment variables for the server (set them on the Cloud Run service; never commit real values).
# Nothing is required: without RESEND_API_KEY and CONTACT_TO_EMAIL the contact form is not emailed.
# README.md ("Contact form email") explains each one.

# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxx
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=you@example.com
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=WDIII Tech Vault <onboarding@resend.dev>
# CONTACT_MAX_PER_HOUR=30
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://www.example.com
# TRUST_PROXY_HOPS=2

# Firebase web (browser) API key served by /api/firebase-config. Required for sign-in/Firestore in the browser.
# Restrict it in Google Cloud (HTTP referrers + Firebase APIs only).
# FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIza...
